bugLike
    It seems that the enemies of our session are bugs specifically to torment us. In other sessions, and in the past, they were more neutral creatures. The power of the AllParent spurs on ever stronger enemies to oppose them.
    While the AllFather cherishes all Life, bugs and other vermin exist only to take from the collective. The underlings of Fenrir and the other Titans are no match for our might.
    It is said that the First Society before Segundia was made of Bug People. Terrible. This means, of course, that any Lamia who closely resemble those who came before, as I unfortunately do, are more loathsome as a matter of course. I try hard to overcome this.:0.5

